  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> is a square and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>N</mi></math> are the middle points of the sides <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> respectively, then the ratio of the areas of the square and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></math> is"
